This is a hard one but keep in mind its a Sliding window Method. 

Start with State = undesirable


if (state == undesirable)
   Keep advancing right pointer and add into System while state undesirable 
   if state == desirable, break out
   if eos, break out

if (state == desirable)
   Keep advancing left pointer while state desirable
   if (state -= undesirable)
      Add previous window to Window Set
      break out

return least Window

